            "Name": "ON_HOLD_ANIMALS",
            "Description": "Animals on HOLD -- someone else's adoption is already in progress on them. These may be MENTIONED so a visitor knows the animal exists, but they are NOT on offer and may never become available. Deliberately a SEPARATE source from AVAILABLE_ANIMALS: the source an animal came from is what tells the agent whether it may offer that animal or merely mention it. Intake and Transferred animals appear in NEITHER source and must never be named.",
